  - ISO 15926
  - benchmarking
abstract: >-
  ISynKGR is a reproducible research benchmark and reference implementation for
  evaluating semantic mapping across heterogeneous industrial standards. It
  combines deterministic adapters, retrieval, rules, ranking, optional LLM
  reasoning, multi-seed experiment orchestration, strict evaluation, and
  publication-oriented reporting.
